pyU3zMeEAQ","children":[{"id":"48","parent":"47","text":"El menos frecuente","guid":"knL6SEffTPafDnbbF87kHA","children":[]},{"id":"49","parent":"47","text":"Llama la atención, incomoda al cuidador","guid":"zQCt_5kzTXy-EBsuipKTOg","children":[]}]},{"id":"50","parent":"43","text":"Mixto → combinación que fluctúa","guid":"Hzxn0G9ST3C8P-3nrWDYCw","children":[{"id":"51","parent":"50","text":"26%","guid":"0VJC-n_1TVye4vcQ5QcYiQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"52","parent":"35","text":"Delirium superpuesto a demencia — zona de peligro","guid":"pb5LoaNNR_qB2GKuECi2WQ","children":[{"id":"53","parent":"52","text":"Paciente con demencia previa + alteración aguda del estado mental","guid":"o-Jj5xlLQ8iRk_DmjPSJHw","children":[]},{"id":"54","parent":"52","text":"Hasta 90% en hospitalizados con demencia","guid":"yYFW5gO3RhaKwn5YLfzuOw","children":[]},{"id":"55","parent":"52","text":"Desafío: desconocemos el estado basal","guid":"RkSWyhG0TcqZd7fpom3fIQ","children":[]},{"id":"56","parent":"52","text":"Mayor subdiagnóstico → mayor mortalidad","guid":"mAEEDKSMQ7WKKqzTAP401w","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"57","parent":"0","text":"Herramientas diagnósticas — CAM","guid":"V4ldoX0BTU6vvUEJgc60IA","children":[{"id":"58","parent":"57","text":"Confusion Assessment Method","guid":"sruQ1yMWSPmG-95eMQMvaQ","children":[{"id":"59","parent":"58","text":"Más utilizada y simple","guid":"njdB1rdATPCyBD77r8kQIQ","children":[]},{"id":"60","parent":"58","text":"NO requiere exámenes","guid":"PVbmGv0fShCPZWiGrBvPcg","children":[]},{"id":"61","parent":"58","text":"Se realiza al lado de la cama","guid":"-bexI8pmSW-1bEOcOAv7ww","children":[]}]},{"id":"62","parent":"57","text":"Criterios CAM","guid":"IOwOjV3FSfSpFJjtu8SnCw","children":[{"id":"63","parent":"62","text":"1. Inicio agudo + curso fluctuante (anamnesis cuidador)","guid":"J-5CxT7lRk-bs1_LbSMn8A","children":[]},{"id":"64","parent":"62","text":"2. Inatención → meses del año al revés, días desde domingo al revés","guid":"njPldiYMThGO88cNBdmwdg","children":[]},{