},{"id":"134","parent":"132","text":"Delirium → DISMINUIDA","guid":"PaOig7eVT-G_75n0dA4V5Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"135","parent":"122","text":"Alerta / conciencia","guid":"_KsR2YryQxq1XngvDaAkIg","children":[{"id":"136","parent":"135","text":"Demencia → normal","guid":"GFsNRHEiSTe8h_V0OaoJZQ","children":[]},{"id":"137","parent":"135","text":"Delirium → DISMINUIDA","guid":"gfTdZBIaR6GR-lTsHjjB2w","children":[]}]},{"id":"138","parent":"122","text":"Pensamiento","guid":"YGOixAClQdaLxWYkLL5kvw","children":[{"id":"139","parent":"138","text":"Demencia → conservado al inicio, deteriora progresivo","guid":"bHpysy5UQ1eZ0JY69yLMVQ","children":[]},{"id":"140","parent":"138","text":"Delirium → DESORGANIZADO","guid":"nXz4FMopRxarvx28DKxYCw","children":[]}]},{"id":"141","parent":"122","text":"Reversibilidad","guid":"jd2-y55TTMipIB9AIIilXg","children":[{"id":"142","parent":"141","text":"Demencia → no reversible (excepto algunas causas)","guid":"rf75-ke-TW-KZt42caF00g","children":[]},{"id":"143","parent":"141","text":"Delirium → REVERSIBLE si se trata la causa","guid":"Pu9Zya7mQuyM1oxwgyKn4w","children":[]}]},{"id":"144","parent":"122","text":"Etiología","guid":"Uf3a5o-aTx65xGVh2-hVNA","children":[{"id":"145","parent":"144","text":"Demencia → neurodegenerativa","guid":"xZBKDAZ1RpiMHjErrDSY6g","children":[]},{"id":"146","parent":"144","text":"Delirium → multifactorial (predisponente + precipitante + perpetuante)","guid":"8FReyn56T8mkZHnGbwY6qw","children":[]}]},{"id":"147","parent":"122","text":"Tratamiento principal","guid":"JUIkqfc5SW6Hh76a1MKPgw","children":[{"id":"148","parent":"147","text":"Demencia → soporte + farmacoterapia modificadora","guid":"oJoNDu-MR2Ox-Y1TtGf0Wg","children":[]},{"id":"149","parent":"147","text":"Delirium → tratar la causa precipitante + medidas ambientales","guid":"HUEEyqv7RpyBlGq9_hHViw","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"150","parent":"0","text":"Manejo de la demencia (resumen)","guid":"TbLCKw-GRjCit1gtS2a9qw","children":[{"id":"151","parent":"150","text":"Objetivo","guid":"Mn3dqVUFRwObpBRq65oGxg","children":[{"id":"152","parent":"151","text":"Ralentizar el declive","guid":"DG35cKHgS4eq1H0klm_KgA","children":[]},{"id":"153","parent":"151","text":"Mantener la función","guid":"Y3FscCawRyWU5siTmPieog","children":[]},{"id":"154","parent":"151","text":"(La demencia NO tiene cura)","guid":"UlRT2CDSSw-O_10oDbb7ow","children":[]}]},{"id":"155","parent":"150","text":"Farmacoterapia","guid":"reJWDle0QWmujj1FssUVzQ","children":[{"id":"156","parent":"155","text":"Individualizada según paciente, preferencias, tipo","guid":"k66B-RBmSB-cupPgdelQ7w","children":[]},{"id":"157","parent":"155","text":"Alzheimer moderado-severo → inhibidores colinesterasa","guid":"p2S_kV7FQACNBvNJyBexug","children":[]}]},{"id":"158","parent":"150","text":"Medidas no farmacológicas","guid":"55EB6QYyRD26N7Aw9YcIeg","children":[{"id":"159","parent":"158","text":"Entrenamiento y estimulación cognitiva","guid":"2KyCKLkLRVKdZalj6GUDOw","children":[]},{"id":"160","parent":"158","text":"Ejercicio físico","guid":"tGIgGcP6ShuL87DWUuDD5A","children":[]},{"id":"161","parent":"158","text":"Nutrición adecuada","guid":"qQ54CTnaRE2Y9fHk051gow","children":[]},{"id":"162","parent":"158","text":"Educación y apoyo al cuidador","guid":"uCMAgdPsSSCS4QvsCPYawg","children":[]},{"id":"163","parent":"158","text":"Educación sobre patología, pronóstico, evolución","guid":"4y6YswxyR4CK0Zmv9hGf7Q","children":[]},{"id":"164","parent":"158","text":"Planificación de seguridad en hogar","guid":"fc15m1sgRYiBHfytZrZLHw","children":[]},{"id":"165","parent":"158","text":"Prevenir burnout del cuidador","guid":"AfpjEhEPSHWT-aHwZrCAJA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"166","parent":"0","text":"Manejo del delirium","guid":"HgaY6qRXS22NWt6FvhNNPQ","children":[{"id":"167","parent":"166","text":"Prioridad absoluta","guid":"mNAunlXESWykMBbz1ul4EA","children":[{"id":"168","parent":"167","text":"Búsqueda activa del factor precipitante","guid":"ceV8QY-NRLe6HCddVqb4OA","children":[]},{"id":"169","parent":"167","text":"Tratamiento de la causa","guid":"-dxjEWKrQLyFTeWRUdtrOw","children":[]}]},{"id":"170","parent":"166","text":"Manejo ambiental — primera línea no farmacológica (Inouye Lancet 2014, Marcantonio NEJM 2017)","guid":"_PoB9xOpRoGF32nCL4G6ig","children":[{"id":"171","parent":"170","text":"Orientación a la realidad → relojes, ventanas, calendarios","guid":"shYOeIK0Sv-DWCa3TiXWpg","children":[]},{"id":"172","parent":"170","text":"Rutinas familiares (horarios y caras conocidas)","guid":"SycFfL94TJqh33WwNfmmvw","children":[]},{"id":"173","parent":"170","text":"Corrección sensorial → lentes, audífonos","guid":"qZUbR0jmTASJM7gMQhHtwg","children":[]},{"id":"174","parent":"170","text":"Movilización temprana → retirar restricciones físicas","guid":"oV0Fo2frRU-VpP_nvxbJvg","children":[]},{"id":"175","parent":"170","text":"Desmedicalización → retirar sondas/vías cuando no son indispensables","guid":"eEh6AznGTqOFLmY5ikRKJg","children":[]},{"id":"176","parent":"170","text":"Manejo del dolor + reposición hidroelectrolítica + manejo del estreñimiento","guid":"ZVEu-WNDThutqR5v6btXYg","children":[]}]},{"id":"177","parent":"166","text":"Programa HELP (Hospital Elder Life Program)","guid":"Md7xCniBTGeTIuhRgh-zhA","children":[{"id":"178","parent":"177","text":"Reducción ~33% incidencia delirium (NNT ~14)","guid":"kQD4L3FLQeiiSL6H10GMQg","children":[]},{"id":"179","parent":"177","text":"6 protocolos: orientación, movilidad, sueño, hidratación, visión, audición","guid":"icbArjYkTTu99eHNreA8og","children":[]}]},{"id":"180","parent":"166","text":"Manejo farmacológico — uso cauteloso, solo si imprescindible","guid":"1l6Ja0UeTnardX3HfOMe3g","children":[{"id":"181","parent":"180","text":"Quetiapina → agitación con riesgo de seguridad","guid":"jioGViLOQri1Wn1RdDTZHg","children":[]},{"id":"182","parent":"180","text":"Haloperidol → agitación con riesgo de seguridad (preferido en hipoactivo asociado a TEP/IAM, evitar en Parkinson/DCL)","guid":"ibGffcqzRPC_ck2cg-uiVw","children":[]},{"id":"183","parent":"180","text":"NO usar BZD salvo abstinencia OH o BZD","guid":"cn0pQRMpS3yn3yKI0qXAww","children":[]}]},{"id":"184","parent":"166","text":"Recordatorio → neurolépticos son ADYUVANTES para seguridad, NO tratamiento causal","guid":"aAmcwwTlRjy-vqPzNjCk3w","children":[]},{"id":"185","parent":"166","text":"Seguimiento","guid":"iV1H-m2GQXuNYzSOq1kNBA","children":[{"id":"186","parent":"185","text":"Monitorizar reserva cognitiva residual / recuperación","guid":"fPbJ7npJT7yLZ-n3JgXhlA","children":[]},{"id":"187","parent":"185","text":"Reasignar trayectoria cognitiva basal","guid":"y67sCHOMTzm6im6DYVHZUg","children":[]},{"id":"188","parent":"185","text":"Hasta 40% NO retornan al basal cognitivo a 6 meses (Marcantonio NEJM 2017) → secuelas reales","guid":"hZ1HOnNJT1-cb5XhBb2x3Q","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"189","parent":"0","text":"Preguntas Autoestudio (oficiales Dra. Daniela Meza)","guid":"ggqslFtrQd2mENFvbnMmlA","children":[{"id":"190","parent":"189","text":"1. ¿Cómo podemos definir demencia?","guid":"W8PMsZc-QHu_Gj9pYn9fqg","children":[]},{"id":"191","parent":"189","text":"2. ¿Cuáles son las principales características del delirio?","guid":"BDhZpNT5RnavC50t8fBLnA","children":[]},{"id":"192","parent":"189","text":"3. Nombre los principales precipitantes de delirium","guid":"BUkmSFY7TNCZE1VDhH_KCQ","children":[]},{"id":"193","parent":"189","text":"4. ¿Cómo se realiza el CAM, cuando sospechamos Delirium?","guid":"2UK4JP18RiGcvvCkvo3EWg","children":[]}]},{"id":"194","parent":"0","text":"Evidencia complementaria (papers oficiales)","guid":"ECzFpw-4RZ2YBkdOktqs7Q","children":[{"id":"195","parent":"194","text":"Manual MINSAL Chile 2019 → marco normativo nacional para diagnóstico y manejo","guid":"G2sC2LcPSNebSZ-WTiOEaA","children":[]},{"id":"196","parent":"194","text":"Manual Geriatría UC 2021 (Carrasco-Born) → capítulo delirium con algoritmo CAM y abordaje multidisciplinario","guid":"llNz43z5T6G1Kx8gTEnihQ","children":[]},{"id":"197","parent":"194","text":"Inouye Lancet 2014 → revisión clásica de delirium; modelo predisponente-precipitante-perpetuante","guid":"gBzXo9AOSb2BjZgRlMgV2g","children":[]},{"id":"198","parent":"194","text":"Wei JAGS 2008 → metaanálisis de CAM: sensibilidad 94% (IC 95% 91-97), especificidad 89% (IC 95% 85-94)","guid":"GdT3YjuTTZyTQwDugrDEiQ","children":[]},{"id":"199","parent":"194","text":"Marcantonio NEJM 2017 → revisión clínica práctica para hospitalizados; hasta 40% no retornan al basal a 6 meses","guid":"kpLDoZWCRdaeQfirGtokvQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"200","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clínicas","guid":"BPKlPplRSDagEFhWAgwxdA","children":[{"id":"201","parent":"200","text":"Perla 1: La pregunta clave que hace el diagnóstico → \"¿es esto nuevo? ¿desde hace días o años?\"","guid":"dSdsn1HGRq-34xR4Xpsp2g","children":[]},{"id":"202","parent":"200","text":"Perla 2: El delirium hipoactivo es el más frecuente y el más ignorado → buscar activamente","guid":"EZGt5QVkScikcSp0Bznh1w","children":[]},{"id":"203","parent":"200","text":"Perla 3: CAM = 1 + 2 + (3 o 4) con sensibilidad 94% / especificidad 89% (Wei 2008) → 4 ítems al lado de la cama","guid":"ALVmemz5TrqsC8rydAtFyw","children":[]},{"id":"204","parent":"200","text":"Perla 4: Hasta 90% de pacientes con demencia hospitalizados desarrollan delirium superpuesto → demencia es FR ×4","guid":"dgWU60-CSPusSwt8Azh4uw","children":[]},{"id":"205","parent":"200","text":"Perla 5: El delirium es prevenible en hasta 30% → movilización temprana + corrección sensorial + orientación + retiro sondas","guid":"beATf4HtSfOZWZcDaOK4RQ","children":[]},{"id":"206","parent":"200","text":"Perla 6: Fármacos perpetuadores ocultos → metoclopramida (anticolinérgica), Viternum, opioides, BZD; revisar y suspender","guid":"BaQLBEs-TwKRXxb6sPyTJg","children":[]},{"id":"207","parent":"200","text":"Perla 7: Diferenciar lo que el paciente NO PUEDE hacer del lo que la familia NO LE DEJA → la sobreprotección confunde el diagnóstico funcional","guid":"K-ax0rlASsG0p34rxkXeAQ","children":[]},{"id":"208","parent":"200","text":"Perla 8: El tratamiento más eficaz del delirium es identificar y tratar la causa → neurolépticos solo para seguridad","guid":"Tcpbw_HhStCgMnxLkSC3hQ","children":[]},{"id":"209","parent":"200","text":"Perla 9: Mortalidad mayor en delirium superpuesto a demencia → aplicar CAM diariamente durante estadía","guid":"XwIL86XxQh-McY2r_c8g7Q","children":[]},{"id":"210","parent":"200","text":"Perla 10: Hidrocéfalo normotensivo + hematoma subdural crónico se descartan con neuroimagen → causas potencialmente reversibles (Hakim-Adams: cefalea + marcha + incontinencia)","guid":"avvd4jqWStetfkZzjHM0Tw","children":[]},{"id":"211","parent":"200","text":"Perla 11: 4AT en 2 min sin entrenamiento → cuando CAM no es viable; sens 76-90%, spec 84-94%","guid":"9Vp9ZRY3QNCaHRJwCwxMuQ","children":[]},{"id":"212","parent":"200","text":"Perla 12: Programa HELP reduce delirium ~33% (NNT 14) → orientación, movilidad, sueño, hidratación, visión, audición","guid":"pd4wbOiyR7GquQjeQGDpjQ","children":[]},{"id":"213","parent":"200","text":"Perla 13: Hasta 40% no recuperan basal cognitivo a 6 meses (Marcantonio 2017) → el delirium NO es \"transitorio benigno\"","guid":"Rwbt_kvOS26fXcsKRYndHQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"214","parent":"0","text":"Conceptos examinados (Evaluaciones SGGCh 2026)","guid":"u015x0YoQSubf5e1JSImTQ","children":[{"id":"215","parent":"214","text":"Evaluacion M2","guid":"o4YOwkVCQ_-m_a9ltEfO_A","children":[{"id":"216","parent":"215","text":"P1 (demencia y estado de conciencia): para diagnostico sindromatico de demencia el paciente DEBE ESTAR ALERTA con conciencia preservada -> si hay alteracion de conciencia primero descartar/tratar delirium antes de evaluar cognitivamente","guid":"bQLzIFSLS5G6VgsJceg1kQ","children":[]},{"id":"217","parent":"215","text":"P9 (delirium vs demencia - inicio + conciencia): delirium = inicio AGUDO + conciencia alterada; demencia = inicio INSIDIOSO + conciencia conservada -> regla mnemica para diferenciar al lado de la cama","guid":"PyVDqiAEQS6tvCIgBr54rg","children":[]},{"id":"218","parent":"215","text":"P10 (Alzheimer + neumonia aspirativa - modelo Inouye 1996): demencia es PREDISPONENTE (vulnerabilidad de base), neumonia es PRECIPITANTE (noxa aguda) -> la desorientacion fluctuante es la MANIFESTACION del delirium, no factor en si","guid":"KPyjnVq8SsGv7a8C9vdGcQ","children":[]},{"id":"219","parent":"215","text":"P22 (delirium vs SPCD - CAM): inicio agudo/subagudo + curso fluctuante + alteracion de la atencion -> SIEMPRE descartar delirium superpuesto a demencia ante SPCD nuevo agudo","guid":"ofhCkkDeRPe8Eo-xQq9kEw","children":[]}]},{"id":"220","parent":"214","text":"Evaluacion Final (transversales)","guid":"us9QrSJpS7uXIdAfqkQcyA","children":[{"id":"221","parent":"220","text":"P6 (demencia estado alerta): mismo concepto repetido -> imprescindible identificar nivel de conciencia antes de evaluar cognitivamente","guid":"6gffoxW9QO-cVEWI3I_QKQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"222","parent":"0","text":"Referencias (bibliografía oficial Dra. Daniela Meza)","guid":"L33iOEvLStiaUyjBG5qovg","children":[{"id":"223","parent":"222","text":"1. MINSAL Chile. Manual de Geriatría para médicos. 2019","guid":"Ygd9HZRUT2qle-NrcGrNCA","children":[]},{"id":"224","parent":"222","text":"2. Carrasco M, Born M (eds). Manual de Geriatría UC: Una mirada práctica e interdisciplinaria. 2021","guid":"nM4TE4JtRPShXeLhiiA8FA","children":[]}]},{"id":"225","parent":"0","text":"Referencias complementarias (citadas en el mapa)","guid":"zGYNPGSUQjyySj-Q1vcoXA","children":[{"id":"226","parent":"225","text":"3. Inouye SK, Westendorp RGJ, Saczynski JS. Delirium in elderly people. Lancet. 2014;383(9920):911-922","guid":"B8Kg1vfYTHiEV4txfR1i2Q","children":[]},{"id":"227","parent":"225","text":"4. Wei LA, Fearing MA, Sternberg EJ, Inouye SK. CAM: a systematic review of current usage. J Am Geriatr Soc. 2008;56(5):823-830","guid":"Z8MmMG7KSqu8jJyQn1VIhw","children":[]},{"id":"228","parent":"225","text":"5. Marcantonio ER. Delirium in hospitalized older adults. N Engl J Med. 2017;377(15):1456-1466","guid":"CbTtRQOCTwuRR4mNYLZUcA","children":[]}]}]},"node_count":228,"relations":[],"cross_references":[],"specialty":"Cardiología","folder":"Entidades clínicas/MKSAP - 18/Cardiología","filename":"11. Enfermedad arterial periférica","id":"map_169","resolved_references":[]}